    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We are delighted to announce the details for our popular Summer Programme. This year, the two-week programme will take Education and Muslim communities as its theme. Held at ISMC's central-London location at 210 Euston Road, the programme will run from 6-17 July 2015 and will be in two parts. Each week can be taken separately and will feature content carefully designed to support and develop professionals and those with an interest in Muslim societies.  Click here to apply online.",
